    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Major Physical Mutation</strong></p><p>Your skin takes on unnatural patterns and hues. Any fur or carapace is also affected. Roll the table below to see what colour ranges you can choose from. You may choose your skin pattern (stripes, dots etc) as you will. You can only gain this mutation once.</p><p></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p>1d100</p></td><td><p>Result</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>01-25</p></td><td><p>Khorne: Reds, blacks, iron, brass, gold. Your Stealth is reduced by -10.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>26-50</p></td><td><p>Nurgle: Sickly greys, browns and greens</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>51-75</p></td><td><p>Slaanesh: Soft pastels</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>76-100</p></td><td><p>Tzeentch: Any contrasting colours. Your Stealth is reduced by -10 .</p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
